		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Ebony-robed skeleton. Styx boatman and Horseman of Death, rides the Pale Horse.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 87, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 pole +9 (1d4 + old age) or 3 <strong>S</strong>tygian bolt (far) +8 (2d10 + old age), <strong>MV</strong> near (fly, swim), <strong>S</strong> +6, <strong>D</strong> +4, <strong>C</strong> +6, <strong>I</strong> +5, <strong>W</strong> +5, <strong>Ch</strong> +5, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 18</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Old Age</strong>. CHA 18+ or become frail and elderly, lose 1d6 STR, DEX, and CON permanently.</p><p></p><p><strong>Pure Evil</strong>. Immune to morale checks. Only damaged by silver or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Styxian Boatman</strong>. As an action, teleport self and creatures within close to anywhere the River Styx touches.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
